      "widgets_values": [
        "# kombify: Image to image (FLUX.1 schnell, 8 GB VRAM)\n\nReviewed StackKits template (derived from the MIT-licensed ComfyUI workflow templates). Models are never bundled. Download the preset once, after reading its license:\n\n```\nstackkit setup ai-image-video --owner-approve\n```\n\nwith `.stackkit/setup/ai-image-video.json` = `{\"preset\":\"flux-schnell\",\"acceptLicense\":\"apache-2.0\"}`.\n\nUpload a picture in Load Image. Denoise 0.75 keeps the composition; lower keeps more of the original."
